WEBVTT

00:03:56.315 --> 00:04:00.528
We cannot exercise
the fundamental human right

00:04:00.528 --> 00:04:05.992
to make decisions about our bodies
and our destinies.

00:04:06.534 --> 00:04:09.787
So why am I so convinced

00:04:09.829 --> 00:04:13.249
that the Supreme Court
is going to overrule Roe and Casey

00:04:13.291 --> 00:04:16.919
and take what is clearly a radical step?

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:19.171
Now, interestingly enough,

00:04:19.213 --> 00:04:24.051
I learned everything I needed to know
to be successful in the Supreme Court

00:04:24.093 --> 00:04:25.386
on “Sesame Street.”

00:04:25.386 --> 00:04:27.471
(Laughter)

00:04:27.513 --> 00:04:28.681
Why?

00:04:28.723 --> 00:04:31.267
Because you've got to learn to count.